rem Cube Digit Pairs
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=90
rem Count pairs of six-digit cubes that
rem show every square below 100

use algo
use sequences
use io

Dice = (0 to 9) combinations 6 copy
Num = Dice len
rem A 9 reads as 6, so fold it first.
Nine' = Dice equal 9
Faces' = Nine choose 6 Dice
Cells = Faces reshape Num 6 1
Seen' = Cells equal (0 to 9)
Has = Seen any axis 1
First = array 0 0 0 1 2 3 4 6 8
Last = array 1 4 6 6 5 6 6 4 1
Lo = Has # First
Hi = Has # Last
A = Lo reshape Num 1 9
B = Hi reshape Num 1 9
C = Lo reshape 1 Num 9
D = Hi reshape 1 Num 9
Fits' = (A and D) or (B and C)
Both' = Fits all axis 2
Id = 0 till Num array
Rows = Id reshape Num 1
Cols = Id reshape 1 Num
Order' = Rows less Cols
Answer = (Both and Order) count
Answer print
